  m_Name: Diko
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Diko
  LastName: Kozlov
  Nickname: 
  Occupation: Coal Miner
  CharacterDescription: Stocky and broad-shouldered, with coal dust worked so deep into his skin that no amount of scrubbing removes it entirely. He speaks in short sentences, makes eye contact without aggression, and expects nothing from a conversation except to get through it quickly. He is not suspicious. He is simply tired.
  CharacterArc: His arc is about endurance without purpose. He is a man defined entirely by his work. As long as the mine runs, he runs with it, steady and unreadable, a fixture at the face. As the infrastructure collapses and the mine is sealed, something slowly detaches. He does not panic. He does not spiral. He simply becomes slightly less present each day, like a lamp running down with no one turning the switch.
  DateOfBirth: 05/03/1938
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 12 MAR
  IsResident: 1
